flowchart TB
    Student[Student / local administrator] --> Browser[React + Vite + Tailwind + Lucide]
    Browser -->|HTTP JSON / multipart| API[FastAPI + Pydantic]
    API --> Retriever[Classification and lexical section retrieval]
    Retriever --> Samples[sample-policies/*.txt]
    Retriever --> Uploads[backend/documents/ local files]
    API --> Prompt[Prompt version files]
    Prompt --> Decision{GEMINI_API_KEY set?}
    Decision -->|No| Demo[Deterministic demo mode]
    Decision -->|Yes| Gemini[Gemini API + configured model]
    Demo --> Verify[Structured response and source verification]
    Gemini --> Verify
    Verify --> API
    API --> Browser
    Tests[Pytest + JSON evaluation runner] --> Retriever
    Tests --> Verify
    Tests --> Results[test-data/demo-evaluation-results.json]
